    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44630" root="&#xA;                        وضع&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            6
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَاضَعَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, lowly, humble,
submissive,</i> or <i>in a state of abasement:</i> (Msb:)
or <i>he lowered, humbled,</i> or <i>abased, himself.</i>
(S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَاضَعَا الرُّهُونَ</span>
                        <i>They two laid bets,
wagers,</i> or <i>stakes, each with the other;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَاهَنَا</span>. (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رهن</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَاضَعَتِ الأَرْضُ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>The land was lower than that which was next
to it.</i> (TA.)

